# Mission: MulkCare MVP Feature-Removal & Flutter Migration

Repository: https://github.com/moamenessamseja-web/mulkcare
Branch: feat/mulkcare-flutter-mvp

## Objective
Remove four feature areas from the existing React/Vite app and migrate to Flutter:
1. AI assistant (AssistantPage, aiService, /assistant route, nav item, i18n keys, VITE_AI_MODE)
2. Local clinic directory (clinic category in LocalInfoPage, i18n keys)
3. Transit directory (transport category in LocalInfoPage, i18n keys)
4. Visible demo content (DemoBanner component, demo badges, demo wording)

## Fixed Rules
- Work on existing repo, preserve relevant functionality
- Keep localStorage persistence intact (store.jsx unchanged)
- Stop when checks are green; do not merge
- Document all decisions in .agent/implementation.md

## Deliverables
- Modified web files (React) with features removed
- Flutter app structure (pubspec.yaml, lib/, android/)
- GitHub Actions workflow for Flutter CI + APK
- .agent documentation (implementation.md, Handoff.md, stute.md, mission)
